menu "Touch Sensor"

    config TOUCH_SENSOR_ENABLE
        bool "Enable Touch Sensor (TTP223)"
        default n
        help
            Enable TTP223 capacitive touch sensor driver.
            Reads digital output from TTP223 via GPIO interrupt.
            When disabled, all API functions return ESP_ERR_NOT_SUPPORTED.

    config TOUCH_SENSOR_GPIO
        int "TTP223 OUT GPIO pin"
        default 21
        range 0 54
        depends on TOUCH_SENSOR_ENABLE
        help
            GPIO pin connected to TTP223 OUT pin.
            TTP223 sync mode: HIGH = touch detected, LOW = released.

    config TOUCH_SENSOR_DEBOUNCE_MS
        int "Software debounce time (ms)"
        default 50
        range 10 200
        depends on TOUCH_SENSOR_ENABLE
        help
            Minimum time between consecutive GPIO interrupt processing.
            TTP223 has built-in hardware debounce; this adds software-level
            filtering for additional noise rejection.
            Lower values = faster response, higher values = more filtering.

    config TOUCH_SENSOR_MIN_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Minimum touch event interval (ms)"
        default 100
        range 50 500
        depends on TOUCH_SENSOR_ENABLE
        help
            Minimum time between two consecutive touch events.
            Events arriving faster than this are filtered as spam/noise.
            100ms is recommended for anti-false-trigger protection.

endmenu
